2026-05-12T10:43:07.1001270Z  > {"github_actor":"thaJeztah","github_actor_id":"1804568","github_event_name":"push","github_event_payload":{"after":"90deaa8fc011b6418ded1872439bd698920448d1","base_ref":null,"before":"cc511e685a40c59273de506a5f99ca35a9783632","commits":[{"author":{"email":"elezar@nvidia.com","name":"Evan Lezar","username":"elezar"},"committer":{"email":"elezar@nvidia.com","name":"Evan Lezar","username":"elezar"},"distinct":false,"id":"704210f9e6d44af1501c7564c82a98653b059b7a","message":"daemon: preserve CDI additional GIDs\n\nCDI injection runs from WithDevices and may append supplementary groups to process.user.additionalGids. Docker's WithUser option previously ran afterwards and replaced Process.User, dropping any CDI-provided groups.\n\nResolve the final container user before device injection so CDI edits append to that user, and add regression coverage for a CDI v0.7 spec that injects additionalGids.\n\nSigned-off-by: Evan Lezar \u003celezar@nvidia.com\u003e","timestamp":"2026-05-08T15:24:38+02:00","tree_id":"8abf3d412602a304215d1fa9a6aa93519acfff02","url":"https://github.com/moby/moby/commit/704210f9e6d44af1501c7564c82a98653b059b7a"},{"author":{"email":"thaJeztah@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sebastiaan van Stijn","username":"thaJeztah"},"committer":{"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub","username":"web-flow"},"distinct":true,"id":"90deaa8fc011b6418ded1872439bd698920448d1","message":"Merge pull request #52579 from elezar/fix-cdi-additional-gids\n\ndaemon: preserve CDI additional GIDs","timestamp":"2026-05-12T12:41:05+02:00","tree_id":"05b2b7f0261e30022a70aac32d13edd055e3fb05","url":"https://github.com/moby/moby/commit/90deaa8fc011b6418ded1872439bd698920448d1"}],"compare":"https://github.com/moby/moby/compare/cc511e685a40...90deaa8fc011","created":false,"deleted":false,"enterprise":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/b/208541?v=4","created_at":"2024-08-08T20:47:18Z","description":"An open framework to assemble speciali